# The official sample's two starter LoRA files (rank 4, 217,672 bytes each, identical) exist on disk in
# agents/baseline_v0_official/ but stay ignored: redistribution terms for competition data are not verified (D003).
# Restore with `python -m tools.preserve_sample`. If the user approves committing them, uncomment EXACTLY these
# lines (they allowlist only these four files, nothing else under any adapters/ dir):
# !agents/baseline_v0_official/adapters/
# agents/baseline_v0_official/adapters/*
# !agents/baseline_v0_official/adapters/main_lora/
# !agents/baseline_v0_official/adapters/tool_lora/
# agents/baseline_v0_official/adapters/*/*
# !agents/baseline_v0_official/adapters/main_lora/adapter_config.json
# !agents/baseline_v0_official/adapters/main_lora/adapter_model.safetensors
# !agents/baseline_v0_official/adapters/tool_lora/adapter_config.json
# !agents/baseline_v0_official/adapters/tool_lora/adapter_model.safetensors

